#: ../../../docs/design/build-system.md:1
msgid "Build system maintenance contract"
msgstr "构建系统维护合同"

#: ../../../docs/design/build-system.md:3
msgid ""
"Nexus uses one authored TOML assembly, a validated immutable configuration "
"IR, static instances and typed factory, and one CMake software target graph."
" Ninja executes the declared graph. Products own application sources and "
"composition."
msgstr ""
"Nexus 使用唯一作者 TOML 装配、验证的不可变配置 IR、静态实例／类型化 factory 和唯一 CMake 软件目标图。Ninja "
"执行声明图；产品持有应用源码及组合。"

msgid "The [build architecture](build-architecture.md) defines the public API, layer ownership and the current B1–B9 implementation tasks. The [MCU onboarding boundary](#verification-plan-for-additional-mcu-families) distinguishes a new board, part, IP and family without duplicating that task list."
msgstr "[构建架构](build-architecture.md)定义公共 API、层级责任与本轮 B1–B9 实施任务。[MCU 接入边界](#verification-plan-for-additional-mcu-families)区分新 Board、料号、IP 和家族，不重复维护任务表。"

#: ../../../docs/design/build-system.md:7
msgid ""
"The [48-item execution ledger](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/83a27dfbee4e8fbf4d35875b1e9db85af7516eec/docs/design/build-"
"system-execution.csv) preserves the requested exit conditions. "
"Implementation, executed software verification, environment distribution and"
" physical acceptance have distinct evidence. Historical source qualification"
" does not qualify changed build tools."
msgstr ""
"[48 项实施台账](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/83a27dfbee4e8fbf4d35875b1e9db85af7516eec/docs/design/build-"
"system-"
"execution.csv)保留请求的退出条件。实现、已执行软件验证、环境分发及物理验收证据独立。历史源码资格不能为修改后的构建工具建立资格。"

#: ../../../docs/design/build-system.md:12
msgid ""
"Configuration publication is a single-writer transaction. It protects every "
"authored and fact input before changing owned output. A rejected or "
"interrupted attempt cannot expose the previous configuration as current. "
"Successful identical generation preserves file content and timestamps so "
"ordinary reconfiguration does not force unrelated compilation. A "
"configuration digest is not a compiler or generator-source identity."
msgstr ""
"配置发布是单写入者事务，在修改所属输出前保护所有作者输入和事实输入。拒绝或中断不能把先前配置作为当前配置暴露。相同成功生成保留内容与时间戳，普通重配置不迫使无关编译。配置摘要不是编译器或生成器源码身份。"

msgid "CMake owns source lists and target dependencies. The resolver emits selected facts and its configuration-code dependencies, never a parallel software build graph. The selected `package.json`, its declared facts and binding files, and the generic configuration-code closure are explicit generation inputs. The package also declares Source SDK export ownership. Board and SoC contain no Python plugins; production uses the generic DataProvider rather than family constructor imports. Package enumeration does not select C source units."
msgstr "CMake 拥有源码列表和目标依赖。resolver 输出所选事实及其配置代码依赖，不建立第二张软件构建图。所选 `package.json`、声明的事实与 binding 文件、通用配置代码闭包都是明确的生成输入。package 也声明 Source SDK 导出归属。Board 和 SoC 不含 Python 插件；生产配置使用通用 DataProvider，不再导入家族构造模块。枚举包不选择 C 源码单元。"

msgid "Physical Platform targets connect selected modes to their necessary public I/O and private provider targets. `Nexus::IOUART` supplies byte UART, shared format validation and necessary wake support; `Nexus::IOUARTWord`, `Nexus::IOUARTStream` and `Nexus::IOUARTRS485` supply explicit extensions. An application using RS485 links its target even when its adapter is assembled outside TOML. Native and CPU Runtime retain caller-defined provider composition. Headers and compile database entries do not prove that a target was built; inspect the actual command closure, objects and linked sections."
msgstr "物理 Platform 目标把已选模式连接到必要的公共 I/O 与私有 provider 目标。`Nexus::IOUART` 提供 byte UART、共享格式校验和必要 wake 支撑；`Nexus::IOUARTWord`、`Nexus::IOUARTStream` 与 `Nexus::IOUARTRS485` 提供显式扩展。使用 RS485 的应用即使在 TOML 外装配适配器，也应链接对应目标。Native 和 CPU Runtime 保留调用者自定义 provider 的组合能力。头文件和编译数据库条目不证明目标已构建；应检查实际命令闭包、对象和链接段。"

msgid "SPI public helpers require wake support, while selected SoC DMA modes connect the DMA target explicitly. `Nexus::IOADCStream` separates ADC stream-profile code and dependencies from the base ADC domain; selected ADC stream modes connect that target. ADC-group block modes connect the shared stream/DMA targets as needed. Block and USB keep shared DMA validation dependencies where their actual paths require them. Splitting follows function references and working consumer builds, not filenames alone."
msgstr "SPI 公共辅助需要 wake 支撑，所选 SoC DMA 模式显式连接 DMA 目标。`Nexus::IOADCStream` 将 ADC stream-profile 代码及依赖从基础 ADC 域分开；已选 ADC 流模式连接此目标；ADC-group 的 block 模式按需连接共享 stream／DMA 目标。Block 与 USB 的实际路径需要共享 DMA 校验时继续保留相应依赖。拆分依据函数引用和实际消费者构建，不能只看文件名。"

msgid "The generated schema-2 `resolved.json` contains effective selections and their input identities, while complete candidate facts remain in the resolver and query path. This reduces output duplication without introducing a second configuration authority or source graph. Generation size, actual compilation work and final Flash/RAM costs are separate measurements."
msgstr "生成的 schema-2 `resolved.json` 保存有效选择及其输入身份，完整候选事实仍在 resolver 与查询路径中。这减少重复输出，不引入第二套配置权威或源码图。生成体积、实际编译工作和最终 Flash/RAM 成本是各自独立的测量。"

msgid "SDK discovery and platform creation are separate operations. `find_package(Nexus CONFIG REQUIRED)` verifies the selected source identity, checks the package version and loads public functions without resolving an assembly or creating production targets. `nexus_add_platform(ASSEMBLY ...)` explicitly creates the one platform. A second assembly or a conflicting SDK source is rejected. The source checkout and installed SDK invoke the same private production target graph. A product does not override platform test or workload defaults."
msgstr "SDK 发现与平台创建是独立操作。`find_package(Nexus CONFIG REQUIRED)` 验证所选源码身份、检查版本并加载公共函数，不解析装配或创建生产目标。`nexus_add_platform(ASSEMBLY ...)` 显式创建唯一平台。第二次装配或冲突 SDK 来源被拒绝。源码 checkout 与安装 SDK 进入同一私有生产图。产品不覆盖平台测试或 workload 默认值。"

msgid "The selected provider publishes `NEXUS_STARTUP_SOURCES` and `NEXUS_STARTUP_USAGE_TARGET` on its target. `Nexus::Platform` references it with `NEXUS_PROVIDER_TARGET`. Firmware creates a separate startup OBJECT for each image and privately consumes that provider-owned usage target. Vendor includes, device defines and HAL configuration do not propagate to application sources. The root does not copy provider-private startup fields between directory scopes."
msgstr "所选 Provider 在其 target 发布 `NEXUS_STARTUP_SOURCES` 与 `NEXUS_STARTUP_USAGE_TARGET`。`Nexus::Platform` 通过 `NEXUS_PROVIDER_TARGET` 引用它。Firmware 为每个 image 创建独立 startup OBJECT，私有消费 Provider 的 usage target。厂商 include、器件宏和 HAL 配置不传播给应用源。根入口不在目录作用域之间搬运 Provider 私有启动字段。"

msgid "`Nexus::ABI` carries binary compatibility requirements, and `Nexus::OS` names the selected backend. Optimization, IPO and compiler launchers apply to actual compilation targets. Runtime specs, `-nostartfiles`, the linker script and final artifact rules belong to the image. Product warnings remain an explicit consumer policy. Actual compiler and linker commands establish these boundaries."
msgstr "`Nexus::ABI` 承载二进制兼容要求，`Nexus::OS` 表示所选后端。优化、IPO 和编译 launcher 应用于实际编译目标。运行库 specs、`-nostartfiles`、链接脚本和最终产物规则属于 image。产品 warning 保持显式消费者策略。实际编译和链接命令证明这些边界。"

msgid "An installed SDK can change after discovery. A later platform or Runtime creation must still detect changed bytes, conflicting revisions and disallowed development fixtures. Verification may be reused only within its synchronous consumption boundary, never through a persistent success flag. The firmware target guarantees declared outputs and its resource check; failure or cancellation cannot leave stale BIN or resource reports as this attempt's result."
msgstr "安装 SDK 在发现后仍可能变化。后续 Platform 或 Runtime 创建必须检出字节变化、revision 冲突和不允许的开发 fixture。验证仅可在同步消费边界内复用，不能使用持久成功标记。固件目标保证声明产物与资源检查；失败或取消不能留下旧 BIN 或资源报告冒充本轮结果。"

#: ../../../docs/design/build-system.md:31
msgid ""
"Developer presets and native CMake/CTest remain the normal build interface. "
"Focused tests are development feedback. Commit gates and formal "
"qualifications execute their complete declared suites with fresh reports. "
"All runners preserve actual command exits, bounded concurrency, deadlines "
"and process cleanup."
msgstr ""
"开发 preset 与原生 CMake/CTest 保持常规构建接口。聚焦测试用于开发反馈；commit gate 与正式资格执行完整声明 "
"suite，生成 fresh 报告。全部 runner 保留真实 command exit、有界并发、deadline 和 process "
"cleanup。"

#: ../../../docs/design/build-system.md:36
msgid ""
"Preparation may retrieve dependencies. Formal reproducibility uses two fresh"
" network-disabled builds with the same verified source SDK and recorded "
"environment and toolchain bytes. Compiler caches improve development only; "
"they cannot prove fresh-build reproducibility. Durable evidence stores "
"retain original records, member identities and failed attempts without "
"changing their historical status."
msgstr ""
"准备阶段可取得依赖。正式可复现性要求同一验证 source SDK、记录的环境和工具链字节进行两次全新禁网构建。Compiler cache "
"只改善开发，不能证明 fresh-build 可复现。持久证据保留原记录、member identity 和失败尝试，不改变历史状态。"

#: ../../../docs/design/build-system.md:42
msgid ""
"Behavioral fixes use actual RED then GREEN execution. Python tools use "
"unittest; C/C++ contracts use the pinned GoogleTest/GoogleMock host "
"framework. CMake graph and policy defects require real small consumer builds"
" and artifact observations. Firmware stays C11 and contains no host test "
"runtime. Normal commit hooks and independent review apply to this "
"maintenance work."
msgstr ""
"行为修复使用实际 RED 后 GREEN。Python 工具用 unittest，C/C++ 合同用锁定 GoogleTest/GoogleMock "
"主机框架。CMake graph/policy 缺陷需真实小型 consumer build 与产物观察。固件保持 C11，无 host test "
"runtime。本维护遵循正常 commit hook 和独立审查。"

#: ../../../docs/design/build-system.md:48
msgid ""
"The following support matrix records observed host tools and declared locks."
" The final clean-source software gates and eight exact offline candidates "
"are recorded in the [execution record](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/delivery/build-"
"system-verification.md). Host observations retain their own scope; source "
"qualification uses the recorded code commit and never follows a later "
"documentation HEAD automatically."
msgstr ""
"下表记录已观测的主机工具与声明的锁定版本。最终 clean-source "
"软件门禁和八个精确的离线候选记录在[执行记录](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/delivery/build-"
"system-verification.md)中。主机观测保留各自的范围；源码资格使用记录中的代码提交，不会自动跟随后续文档 HEAD。"

