msgid "Contribution"
msgstr "接入类型"

msgid "Owning changes"
msgstr "所属修改"

msgid "Required observations"
msgstr "所需观察"

msgid "Existing part, new PCB"
msgstr "已有料号的新 PCB"

msgid "Board facts, wiring and authored assembly"
msgstr "Board 事实、接线和手写装配"

msgid "Resolve legal and conflicting connections, link the image and record physical status"
msgstr "解析合法与冲突接线，链接镜像并记录物理状态"

msgid "Reviewed IP, new exact part"
msgstr "受审 IP 的新精确料号"

msgid "Family device, package, memory, clock, route and errata facts"
msgstr "家族器件、封装、内存、时钟、路线与勘误事实"

msgid "Exact header and startup vector, absent peripheral rejection, ABI and memory map"
msgstr "精确头与启动向量、缺失外设拒绝、ABI 和内存图"

msgid "Existing semantics, new IP"
msgstr "已有语义的新 IP"

msgid "Package-private C, binding and local CMake"
msgstr "包内 C、binding 和局部 CMake"

msgid "Shared API contract plus IP-specific reset, IRQ, DMA, stop and failure behavior"
msgstr "共享 API 合同，以及 IP 专有 reset、IRQ、DMA、停止和失败行为"

msgid "New family or vendor"
msgstr "新家族或厂商"

msgid "SoC package, startup contract, drivers, official dependencies and SDK ownership"
msgstr "SoC 包、启动合同、驱动、官方依赖与 SDK 归属"

msgid "Exact-part link, private SDK scope, a real external consumer and explicit physical status"
msgstr "精确料号链接、私有 SDK 范围、真实外部消费者和明确物理状态"

msgid "New architecture or public semantics"
msgstr "新架构或公共语义"

msgid "Corresponding Arch, toolchain or public contract"
msgstr "对应 Arch、工具链或公共合同"

msgid "Compiler/ABI and behavioral validation of the newly introduced concept"
msgstr "新概念的编译器／ABI 与行为验证"

msgid "Reuse of known capabilities should add no MCU-name branches to the common resolver or build dispatcher. A new architecture, clock topology or DMA model requires its own reviewed contract when existing concepts cannot express it. CMake continues to own all translation units and software edges. Board and SoC packages remain declarative facts plus C hardware behavior."
msgstr "复用已知能力不应向公共 resolver 或构建调度器增加 MCU 名字分支。现有概念无法表达新架构、时钟拓扑或 DMA 模型时，需要经过审查的独立合同。CMake 继续拥有全部翻译单元与软件依赖。Board 和 SoC 包保持声明式事实与 C 硬件行为。"

msgid "Compare a representative source consumer, relocated and read-only SDK consumer, CPU Runtime, and maintained F4 targets. Inspect compiler/linker commands, per-image startup isolation, selected units, vectors, sections and budgets. An external provider fixture demonstrates the integration contract without granting that family production or physical support."
msgstr "对照代表性源码消费者、搬迁与只读 SDK 消费者、CPU Runtime 和维护的 F4 目标。检查编译／链接命令、每镜像启动隔离、所选单元、向量、段与预算。外置 Provider fixture 证明接入合同，不授予该家族生产或实板支持。"

msgid "Preserve no-change incremental builds, fact-triggered reconfiguration, budget rejection, missing-output recovery and failure withdrawal. Time configure, compilation, linking and validation separately under a declared worker budget. Use focused complete regressions during implementation and the required final integration once against the frozen source; no successful test report is cached. Physical HIL remains `not_executed` until equipment executes its own checks."
msgstr "保留无变化增量构建、事实触发重配、预算拒绝、缺失产物恢复和失败撤销。在明确并行预算下分别计时 configure、编译、链接和验证。实施中运行相关完整回归，最终冻结源码只执行一次规定集成，不缓存成功测试报告。设备实际执行前，物理 HIL 保持 `not_executed`。"
